Subject: [PATCH] Recover Codex auto summaries on SSE within the existing retry budget

Backport of the relevant parts of denispol/pi commit
04bab8e2cdfd54d6bd09eda1be97c25562725c31 (Pi #10781 / #11202),
including the transport work from ioki-smore/pi commit
61577508ae95de8a88e029fc9387f5b6ccd960b7.
Adapted to our pinned Pi 1.5.0; regression coverage extended locally.
The unrelated endpoint-affinity and auth-test changes are excluded.

